{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》今晚（27日）播出第七集，以經典粵菜「咕嚕肉」為主題，星級食評家麥玲玲、樊亦敏和糖妹坐鎮，氣氛本應熱鬧，卻因一道菜的創新煮法引爆激烈爭議！有食店竟大膽以豬頸肉取代傳統梅頭，結果引來極端評價，更出現節目首間「Bye」多過「Buy」的餐廳，專業評分更低至54.9分，究竟是哪間餐廳踩中地雷？\n</p>\n<h2>今晚播出｜咕嚕肉新煮法引爆爭議</h2>\n<p>今晚和明晚播出的節目中，四間分別來自油麻地、尖沙咀、銅鑼灣及廣州的餐廳，以自家製的咕嚕肉一決高下，價錢由78元人民幣（約92港元）至248港元不等，競爭激烈。然而，其中一間食店的「咕嚕肉」卻未能征服評審團，更成為節目開播以來首間獲得「Bye」比「Buy」更多的餐廳，專業評分更錄得54.9分的低分，令全場嘩然，到底這道「咕嚕肉」出了甚麼問題，引發如此巨大的爭議？</p>\n<h2>鼎爺楊國基堅持傳統 狠批豬頸肉口感</h2>\n<p>節目中，一間食店以豬頸肉代替傳統梅頭製作咕嚕肉，立即引發傳統派評審的不滿。行業廚務顧問楊國基率先表示：「我麻麻地豬頸肉去做囉，佢好聰明用啲木瓜、用啲雜菜去醃佢，但始終覺得梅頭咬落去係舒服好多。」明確表達了對傳統口感的堅持。而廚藝界權威李家鼎（鼎爺）亦和應，語帶保留地說：「因為好多嘢都唔係咁樣做法，或者各施各法啦。」言下之意似乎對這種創新手法不太認同，令現場氣氛一度變得緊張。</p>\n<h2>總廚李文星力撐創新 大讚豬頸肉夠脆</h2>\n<p>雖然傳統派對豬頸肉咕嚕肉有保留，但亦有評審持相反意見，Mott32集團行政總廚李文星就對此讚不絕口，更坦言給予高分。他力撐創新煮法，並解釋其原因：「因為豬頸肉本身係脆嘅，佢食到最尾一舊都係脆嘅。」他認為豬頸肉的爽脆口感能由頭帶到尾，是一種成功的嘗試。新舊兩派的觀點壁壘分明，就一道咕嚕肉的用料展開激烈辯論，火藥味十足。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議新舊派大戰：「食咕嚕肉緊係要梅頭！」</h2>\n<p>節目預告一出，隨即引發網民熱烈討論，對於咕嚕肉應該用梅頭還是豬頸肉，網民意見亦分為兩派。不少網民留言力撐傳統做法：「咕嚕肉用豬頸肉根本係邪道！」、「支持鼎爺，傳統先係最好食！」、「脆係脆，但冇咗嗰種肉質同鬆化嘅口感。」不過，也有支持創新的網民表示：「時代要進步啦，試下新嘢有咩問題？」、「豬頸肉脆卜卜，諗起都想食！」、「最緊要好食，理得佢用咩肉。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_15807316756ae0371b09041.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_15807316756ae0371b09041.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_3110065506ae0371e7d59f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_3110065506ae0371e7d59f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7001450856ae03721ae6c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7001450856ae03721ae6c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_10105828136ae03724e3836.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_10105828136ae03724e3836.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7967722056ae037291d526.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7967722056ae037291d526.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_19183808776ae0373c3a244.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_19183808776ae0373c3a244.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:37.513598+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1215,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:33:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:39.038097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:58:46.958238+00:00","content_hash":"9ffc27cf600cf66ad2d39da5dd09885611366c672cfb5281e0ad1a7bc062f5b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}